  "body": "Some developments maximize density. This one maximizes lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWelcome to an exclusive collection of just three brand-new freehold standalone homes on sought-after Cherry Road, Bucklands Beach. With only three residences on the site, each home enjoys generous separation from its neighbours, creating a greater sense of space, privacy and natural light than many of today’s new developments.\r\n\r\nCherry Road is a wide, established street with plenty of on-street parking for family and visitors. Inside, every home has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, featuring contemporary open-plan spaces, private outdoor areas and a spacious internal access garage pre-wired for EV charging and additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe largest home in the development, Lot 3 offers a flexible layout ideally suited to larger or multi-generational families. The ground-floor bedroom with an ensuite is perfect for extended family, guests or working from home.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n• Five bedrooms\r\n• Three and a half bathrooms\r\n• Ground-floor bedroom with ensuite\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n• Spacious internal access garage with pre-wired for ev charging\r\n• Master Builder Warranty\r\n• Price by Negotiation\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nEveryday convenience is close at hand, with Highland Park Shopping Centre and Pak’nSave only minutes away. Lloyd Elsmore Park, local cafés, restaurants, public transport and the Eastern Beaches are also within easy reach.\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nWith only three standalone freehold homes and generous spacing, Lot 3 offers ample space for the whole family. With a garage that includes pre-wired for ev charging and a highly sought-after Bucklands Beach location, 3/31 Cherry Road offers a quality of living that is increasingly hard to find.",
